# Gemini API key. Powers the AI Architect (Coach tab), the food-photo scan in FUEL,
# and the daily rewrite of the System's alert copy.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key. The app runs fine without it:
# alerts fall back to the built-in phrase bank, and the Coach reports a severed link.
#
# WARNING: vite inlines this into the client bundle, so it is visible to anyone
# who loads the app. Only use a key you are willing to expose, and move these
# calls behind a server route before deploying publicly.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
